> > > #> 24 textual ~~   speed       0.173 0.049 3.518  0.000    0.077    0.270
> > > #> 25    diff :=   a2-a1  diff 0.216 0.161 1.348  0.178   -0.098    0.531
> > > standardizedSolution(fit2)[c(10, 11, 21:25), ]
