Cohen, Patricia, Cohen, Jacob, Aiken, Leona S.,  West, Stephen G. (1999).  The Problem of Units and the Circumstance for POMP.  Multivariate Behavioral Research. 1999, Vol. 34 Issue 3, p315. 32p.

